/.claude/agents
/skills-lock.json

# Presence-work brand data: pre-verification business facts (registration
# numbers, addresses, NTN) that should never land in a public repo's git
# history. Only the verified subset ever reaches the public site, gated by
# content/configuration/company-facts.ts; this file holds more than that.
/brand

# SEO audit tool output (point-in-time, regenerate with /seo audit)
/*-audit/
seomator.toml
